           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                     ‍\n                    </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                     ‍\n                    </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                     ‍\n                    </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rahfdnkqs84iaeicBeia0b57ZbhVK1kpkHmUOJibHwHpJJk4XRgvWXPxdIVwnZ8naE3Dylywa1dwBETg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n                    15岁时，Juan和他的兄弟们一起开始了他们自己的第一个咖啡农场，当时的种植面积大概有2.5公顷，到现在扩展到5公顷，目前种植的品种有卡杜拉，哥伦比亚，粉波旁，波旁，爪哇以及瑰夏。\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                       ‍\n                      </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rahfdnkqs84iaeicBeia0b57Z6Decte7EiaG0GZch7Kw7dbwTCVrK1sQ1JN1XZ5NJY8LuzrSQAdb2ypA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 24px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;text-align: left;'>\n                   这只瑰夏入口很红色莓果，带着淡淡的花香，接着会有像菠萝的酸感和紫色葡萄的香气，中低温又一丢丢番石榴跑出来，尾韵有一丝无花果干的风味，很有意思～\n                   <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);visibility: visible;text-align: center;'>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n                     更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n                    </span>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);visibility: visible;text-align: center;'>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n                     公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n                    </span>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;min-height: 1em;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 431px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
